      "text": "Step 4 — weighted average of Values\n\noutput(\"wo\") =\n  0.10·V(Ravi) + 0.62·V(ball)\n+ 0.06·V(maari) + 0.22·V(bhaari)\n\n→ \"wo\" ka naya vector mostly\n   BALL ki information rakhta hai ✓",
      "originalText": "Step 4 — weighted average of Values\n\noutput(\"wo\") =\n  0.10·V(Ravi) + 0.62·V(ball)\n+ 0.06·V(maari) + 0.22·V(bhaari)\n\n→ \"wo\" ka naya vector mostly\n   BALL ki information rakhta hai ✓",
